cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Journal Atlas in your research or work, please cite it as below."
title: "Journal Atlas: A Community-Maintained Knowledge Base of Academic Journal Fit Metadata"
abstract: >-
  Journal Atlas is an AI-native, community-maintained knowledge base that
  captures the soft metadata of academic journals — reviewer culture, framing
  requirements, methodological preferences, sensitive topic receptiveness, and
  rejection fallback chains — that existing bibliometric tools (Impact Factor,
  SCImago, JCR) do not cover. Distributed as a Claude Agent Skill compatible
  with Claude Desktop, Claude Code, ChatGPT, and other agent platforms.
type: dataset
