    year: 2025
    journal: "Frontiers in Computer Science — Human-Media Interaction"
    notes: >-
      Theoretical foundation. Journal Atlas emerged during the manuscript
      submission process of this paper and is itself an instantiation of ASAF's
      agent-identity-as-collaboration-interface principles: each journal entry
      acts as a structured affordance surface that human and AI agents can
      jointly reason over.
